T解决方案以及维护和支持服务。"],"lines_en":["Rail Safety and Geospatial Solutions: Provides rail safety solutions and geospatial solutions to rail operators and related industries.","Intellectual Property Rights Licensing: Offers licensing of intellectual property rights.","Business and IT Development Support: Provides business and IT development support services.","Engineering, Maintenance, and Support Services: Offers engineering, maintenance, support, and related services.","R&D and Turnkey Systems: Engages in research and development and turnkey systems and solutions for platform safety systems.","GIS and ICT Solutions: Provides GIS solutions, ICT solutions, and maintenance and support services."]}}